      "dom_id": "step-q79955",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Find the differential $\\text{d}f$ for the function $f(x,y)={x}^{2}+{y}^{2}.$",
      "worked_solution": "We compute the differential using the formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}f(x,y) & =(\\frac{∂f}{∂x})\\,\\text{d}x+(\\frac{∂f}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =2x\\,\\text{d}x+2y\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$",
