      "dom_id": "step-q79956",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "Find the differential $\\text{d}f$ for the function $f(x,y)=xy+{y}^{2}.$",
      "worked_solution": "We compute the differential using the formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}f(x,y) & =(\\frac{∂f}{∂x})\\,\\text{d}x+(\\frac{∂f}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =y\\,\\text{d}x+(x+2y)\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$",
